&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realize your potential by joining the leading performance-driven advertising company and a proud Great Place to Work® Certified employer!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a proactive, analytical, and detail-oriented Content Success Specialist to join our Global Content Review Team. This role is a critical partner to our advertisers and their Account Managers, sitting at the intersection of policy, performance, and creative strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you won&#39;t just react to problems—you&#39;ll prevent them. You will deeply understand a portfolio of advertiser accounts, continuously monitor their content performance data, and provide strategic, actionable guidance to improve creative approval rates and overall campaign health. You will be the subject-matter expert on content compliance, helping advertisers clients and our internal Account Managers navigate policies to achieve their business goals without friction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;To thrive in this role, you’ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience in a client-facing role (e.g., Account Management, Client Success, Ad Operations) with direct client communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of content moderation and platform policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in ad tech, creative optimization, or content compliance is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret performance data and use it to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in using BI tools, spreadsheets, and internal reporting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, results-oriented attitude with a hands-on approach to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with global teams/ a remote supervisor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in ad tech, creative optimization, or content compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide actionable, data-driven recommendations to improve creative approval and performance for a dedicated portfolio of key advertiser accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor dashboards daily to proactively identify risks and performance, surfacing issues before they escalate and uncover opportunities for creative optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze content performance data to identify performance trends and suggest refresh strategies that align with platform policies and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the subject-matter expert linking Policy and Account Management teams, interpreting compliance guidelines to support advertiser success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track key metrics (e.g., compliance, approvals, creative health) and maintain dashboards or reports to inform recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute insights for Quarterly Business Reviews (QBRs) and strategic meetings by maintaining a deep understanding of assigned accounts and their content performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
