&lt;p&gt;As an Advertising Account Management Director on the Enterprise team in our Bangkok office, you&#39;ll play a vital role in leading a team of Account Managers responsible for SEA to develop the growth strategy for an existing book of business. Working closely with the Sales Director and Country Manager, you&#39;ll align on regional priorities and drive strategic initiatives that accelerate business performance. Acting in a consultative sales capacity, this person will partner with cross-functional teams to lead client relationships and identify up-sell/optimization opportunities at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
