&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a motivated, commercially driven and growth-focused BDR to join our DACH Growth team in Berlin. In this role, you’ll be responsible for re-defining the outbound playbook, prospecting and testing new sales tools, setting appointments for Sales Reps and driving significant revenue growth in the DACH market. You’ll act as a consultant and first point of contact to advertisers, working with a fast-moving, high-potential market, while collaborating cross-functionally with internal teams to optimize performance and deliver results.&lt;/p&gt;
