&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realize your potential by joining the leading performance-driven advertising company!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Business Systems &amp;amp; Solutions Specialist on the Information Systems team in our New York office, you’ll play a vital role in partnering closely with Sales and Account Management teams to &lt;strong&gt;design, build, and implement CRM, automation, and GenAI-powered solutions.&lt;/strong&gt; This is a builder-centric role focused on improving day-to-day workflows, accelerating productivity, and helping our global revenue engine scale more effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To thrive in this role, you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2–5+ years of hands-on experience in Enterprise Business Systems&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Salesforce, Dynamics 365).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track &lt;strong&gt;record of designing and deploying complex, multi-stage automations &lt;/strong&gt;(e.g., Salesforce Advanced Flows) - managing thousands of records and hundreds of users without compromising system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong understanding of sales or go-to-market processes&lt;/strong&gt; and how to map them to technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience implementing GenAI solutions&lt;/strong&gt; for business users. Hands-on experience or deep conceptual knowledge of implementing GenAI solutions for business users (e.g., LLM-based integrations, prompt engineering for sales automation, RAG-based tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to &lt;strong&gt;bridge the gap between AI capabilities and practical sales workflows&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., lead enrichment, predictive scoring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on &lt;strong&gt;experience in vibe coding, light scripting or coding experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to &lt;strong&gt;work autonomously, take ownership&lt;/strong&gt; of deliverables, and collaborate effectively with a manager and team based in a different time zone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Light scripting or coding experience (e.g., Python, JavaScript) to augment &quot;no-code&quot; solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL/SOQL for data analysis and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Implement&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with global business stakeholders to translate complex requirements into technical solutions within business applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Automation at Scale&lt;/strong&gt;: Design, build, and maintain enterprise declarative automation (e.g., Salesforce Flow, Dynamics Business Rules) that supports hundreds of users across global regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneer GenAI Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;: Identify high-value use cases for Generative AI within our business processes. You will prototype and deploy LLM-driven tools (e.g., automated sales assistance, intelligent data synthesis) using APIs and native AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale through Enablement: &lt;/strong&gt;Transform our Sales team from &quot;users&quot; to &quot;builders&quot; by teaching them to create their own low-code GenAI tools, speeding up their daily workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Introduce new tools and capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;: Learn and onboard new tools quickly, implementing best practices and adapting solutions as business needs evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: Manage the end-to-end lifecycle of system enhancements, from discovery and sandbox testing to production deployment and user adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with global Information Systems and Integration/Development teams on cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
