&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realize your potential by joining the leading performance-driven advertising company!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola is seeking a dynamic Country Manager for Japan to lead our growth, strengthen our reputation, and build a strong, people-centric culture in the region. This role calls for an experienced sales leader with a deep understanding of the Japanese ad-tech landscape, capable of designing and executing bold strategies while fostering collaboration across diverse teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola Japan has experienced rapid growth on both the advertiser and publisher sides, working with many of Japan’s top agencies, advertisers, publishers, data partners, DSPs, and other key local players.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Country Manager will play a pivotal role in expanding Taboola’s business and operations in Japan by creating impactful sales strategies, defining a clear road map, building meaningful partnerships, and driving revenue growth. We are looking for a leader who can execute quickly, operate independently, and isn’t afraid to get their hands dirty while fostering collaboration across diverse teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Country Manager of Taboola Japan must possess a strong drive to consistently achieve double-digit annual growth, demonstrating unwavering focus on scaling the business and delivering exceptional results year after year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To thrive in this role, you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Japan Market Expertise: Proven track record in the Japanese ad-tech industry with 5+ years of experience and exceptional knowledge of the local advertiser, publisher, and revenue ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales &amp;amp; Leadership Experience: 10+ years in key sales positions, including managing large teams or organizations of 30+ people, with strong leadership skills and deep familiarity with the business environment in Japan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Visionary: Ability to design a comprehensive and sustainable business model tailored to Japan’s unique growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client-Focused Relationship Builder: Skilled in developing long-lasting relationships with top advertisers, publishers, and agencies, leveraging deep local market understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Leader: Experience as a Representative Director (or equivalent senior position) overseeing operations, including sales strategies, trade shows, and quality initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technologically Savvy: Expertise in digital advertising, video, and ad-tech systems, with the ability to explain product benefits within this context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultural Awareness: Sensitivity toward cultural differences and fluency in both Japanese and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-On Approach: A proactive and results-oriented attitude, with the ability to take ownership, drive initiatives to completion, and adapt quickly to challenges. Demonstrates a willingness to be deeply involved in operational and strategic tasks to achieve business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth-Oriented Mindset: Strong drive to achieve double-digit year-over-year business growth, with a focus on scaling the organization and driving results rather than solely managing an established team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
