&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a tailored strategy to expand Taboola’s advertiser and publisher business in Japan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate new business, manage a robust pipeline, and accurately forecast growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strategic partnerships with key stakeholders, aligning them with a coherent product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close deals with publishers and advertisers, while proactively identifying new market opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate in deal structuring and collaborate with internal teams to support seamless implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Championing our in-market reputation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Taboola at industry events, trade shows, and roadshows to drive brand preference and loyalty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with key local partners, including advertisers, publishers, and agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide insights to the product team to shape product development based on client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
