&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Creative Lead &lt;/strong&gt;in the &lt;strong&gt;Ad Design Services &lt;/strong&gt;team based in our Gurgaon office, you’ll play a vital role in guiding and elevating the creative output of Taboola’s Ad Design Services team.&lt;br&gt;This is a hands-on creative leadership role, focused on defining visual direction, applying creative best practices, and ensuring high-quality ad delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll act as the creative authority for incoming requests: shaping direction, guiding designers through execution, and reviewing ads before delivery to ensure they meet both creative and business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To thrive in this role, you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
