&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to set visual direction and guide others in execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent eye for design, layout, hierarchy, and visual storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing, refining, and approving creatives in fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to give clear, constructive feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand business needs and marketing objectives and translate them into creative guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English (verbal and written)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Major Plus if hands-on graphic design experience (static and/or motion)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to jump into files, sketch ideas, or demonstrate execution approaches when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Adobe Creative Suite (PS, AI, AE)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Generative AI tools for creative ideation, image creation, or motion exploration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in performance marketing, native advertising, or growth-focused creative teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Creative Lead&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll bring value by:&lt;/p&gt;
