&lt;li&gt;Define clear visual direction, creative angles, and execution guidance for each task or campaign&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide graphic and motion designers throughout the creative process with clear, actionable feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all creatives follow creative best practices, platform guidelines, and performance-driven principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve ads before delivery to ensure quality, clarity, and consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help translate business objectives and campaign goals into strong, effective visual solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to building and maintaining creative standards, visual frameworks, and best-practice guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with AMs, strategists, and internal stakeholders to ensure smooth creative workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
