&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide first-line HR advice to managers and employees across EMEA on policies, people processes, and employee lifecycle matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support managers with performance management, parental leave, absence issues, flexible working requests, and general employee queries, escalating appropriately where required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the HR Director in managing employee relations cases, including documentation, preparation for meetings, and coordination with local HR or legal partners as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the HR Shared Service Centre (SSC) to ensure smooth handling of transactional, repetitive, and location-agnostic HR activities&lt;/li&gt;
