&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Sales Director, UK Direct Enterprise Advertisers&lt;/strong&gt;, in our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; office, you will lead and grow Taboola’s Enterprise advertiser direct business by running a team of sellers and account managers - working to land new opportunities and grow our incredible momentum in this market and scale the business further.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola is the global leader in powering recommendations and driving performance at scale via the open web, helping people discover what&#39;s interesting and new in the digital world. We partner with the world’s leading brands, publishers, and advertisers to deliver engaging, personalized experiences to billions of users.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are at an incredible stage in our journey, having signed a 30 year partnership with Yahoo, becoming the official reseller for Apple News and having launched a high end premium solution for Enterprise brands across the world’s leading publishers including The Independent, Future and Reach, we are poised to grow rapidly and need someone who can capture the market opportunity for us and lead the agency business to success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To thrive in this role, you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 10 years in a key sales leadership position, selling scalable solutions to UK advertisers (preferably from performance advertisers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must come with experience of directly managing, recruiting and developing a sales and AM team of at minimum 6 people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must come with proven success in securing and scaling customer budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in independently building, pursuing and closing a large pipeline of leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in structuring and negotiating deals within the digital media space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring sales and account managers and paving the way for them to excellent performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be technologically savvy – ability to learn what is needed to support deal’s successful implementation and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in building a great team culture and team camaraderie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast paced, quickly changing environment and consistently learn, adapt and develop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with performance customers would be highly beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
