&lt;li&gt;Define the ‘direct’ strategy for the team and come up with creative ways of cutting through the noise and getting in front of key contacts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear goals and KPIs for the team, regularly tracking and optimizing performance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the clients’ organization and produce and manage ‘client mapping’ for key clients and keep these up-to-date at all times&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
