&lt;li&gt;Offer multiple Taboola products to a given client by finding the right stakeholders for each product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain excellent understanding of digital technology, video, and revenue ecosystem to be able to explain product benefits within this context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Country Manager to consistently achieve and exceed revenue goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the book of business with a strong ICP customer base that can grow into key advertisers that spend &amp;gt;$500k+ per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pitch, sign and manage JBA’s with key clients&lt;/li&gt;
