&lt;li&gt;Proven track &lt;strong&gt;record of designing and deploying complex, multi-stage automations &lt;/strong&gt;(e.g., Salesforce Advanced Flows) - managing thousands of records and hundreds of users without compromising system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong understanding of sales or go-to-market processes&lt;/strong&gt; and how to map them to technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience implementing GenAI solutions&lt;/strong&gt; for business users. Hands-on experience or deep conceptual knowledge of implementing GenAI solutions for business users (e.g., LLM-based integrations, prompt engineering for sales automation, RAG-based tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to &lt;strong&gt;bridge the gap between AI capabilities and practical sales workflows&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., lead enrichment, predictive scoring).&lt;/li&gt;
