&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Light scripting or coding experience (e.g., Python, JavaScript) to augment &quot;no-code&quot; solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL/SOQL for data analysis and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Implement&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with global business stakeholders to translate complex requirements into technical solutions within business applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Automation at Scale&lt;/strong&gt;: Design, build, and maintain enterprise declarative automation (e.g., Salesforce Flow, Dynamics Business Rules) that supports hundreds of users across global regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneer GenAI Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;: Identify high-value use cases for Generative AI within our business processes. You will prototype and deploy LLM-driven tools (e.g., automated sales assistance, intelligent data synthesis) using APIs and native AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale through Enablement: &lt;/strong&gt;Transform our Sales team from &quot;users&quot; to &quot;builders&quot; by teaching them to create their own low-code GenAI tools, speeding up their daily workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Introduce new tools and capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;: Learn and onboard new tools quickly, implementing best practices and adapting solutions as business needs evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: Manage the end-to-end lifecycle of system enhancements, from discovery and sandbox testing to production deployment and user adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with global Information Systems and Integration/Development teams on cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
