&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Python, Java, TensorFlow, Spark, Kafka, Cassandra, HDFS, ElasticSearch, AirFlow, BigQuery, Google Cloud Platform, Kubernetes and Docker&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
