&lt;li&gt;Industry Expertise: In-depth knowledge of the UK digital ecosystem and media landscape, with a genuine passion for online marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand Portfolio Management: Experience managing diverse brand portfolios across different verticals, prioritizing clients based on potential and driving portfolio growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scalability &amp;amp; Innovation: A keen ability to identify and articulate opportunities for clients to achieve significant scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical Prowess: Exceptional analytical skills, with the ability to translate data into actionable insights and reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship Mastery: Outstanding relationship management and customer-facing skills, with the ability to build rapport and trust with clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Aptitude: Excellent technological skills or the ability to quickly learn and master new technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Adaptability: The ability to thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication Skills: Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Readiness: Willingness to travel for business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Partnership Management: Act as a trusted advisor to our top clients, understanding unique needs and objectives. You&#39;ll develop and execute tailored strategies to drive growth, scale campaigns, and ensure alignment with client KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Sales Mindset: Experience in initiating and building strong client relationships with an eye toward uncovering new business possibilities within existing BoB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-Driven Insights &amp;amp; Strategy: Dive deep into campaign data, uncovering actionable insights and creating compelling reports that demonstrate the value of the Taboola platform. Using insights to guide strategic recommendations and optimize campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Empowerment &amp;amp; Education: Proactively educate clients on best practices, new product features, and optimization strategies. You&#39;ll empower them to become experts on our platform and achieve their campaign goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Support &amp;amp; Campaign Management: Provide first-level technical support, assisting with campaign setup, conversion tracking, and targeting. You&#39;ll also collaborate with our Ad Ops team to resolve complex technical issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Expansion: Identify and capitalize on opportunities to upsell and cross-sell our products and services, driving revenue growth through new product adoption and international expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship Building &amp;amp; Advocacy: Conduct regular client meetings, QBRs, and vertical roadshows, building strong relationships with key stakeholders from day-to-day contacts to C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-Site Collaboration &amp;amp; Client Engagement: Spend dedicated time, fostering deeper relationships and providing real-time support. Attend industry events and social gatherings, representing our company as a key marketing partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal Advocacy: Be a passionate advocate for your partners within our organization, ensuring their needs are met and their voices are heard.&lt;/li&gt;
