&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-being:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy comprehensive benefits (health, dental, vision, 401k matching), pre-tax commuter benefits, a fully stocked kitchen, parking and various gym partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility: &lt;/strong&gt;We offer a hybrid work schedule with 3 days in-office with an option to come in more often if desired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with some of the biggest names: &lt;/strong&gt;Our publisher partners include Yahoo, Conde Nast, Fox Sports, NBCU, ESPN, CBS, and E! Online. Our advertiser clients include Wells Fargo, Honda, Pinterest, Expedia and Honda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to realize your potential?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola is an equal opportunity employer and we value diversity in all forms. We are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and believe such an environment is critical for success. Employment is decided on the basis of qualifications, merit, and business need.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about #TaboolaLife on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?fetchDeterministicClustersOnly=true&amp;amp;heroEntityKey=urn%3Ali%3Aorganization%3A128707&amp;amp;keywords=taboola&amp;amp;origin=RICH_QUERY_SUGGESTION&amp;amp;position=2&amp;amp;searchId=dcc8bfbb-b05c-458e-a7f1-726d30e7dd80&amp;amp;sid=9(y&amp;amp;spellCorrectionEnabled=false&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/taboola/&quot;&gt; Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/taboola.israel/?hl=en&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1BctKkw2Vj_EOjvy24kjRKq_ZxZzmZxweIqNLQgsLtcs/edit?tab=t.0&quot;&gt; X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6W0hdStO0jRVYhg4ABzjRw&quot;&gt; YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, &amp;amp; the&lt;a href=&quot;https://bit.ly/41kidx9&quot;&gt; Taboola Life Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Taboola&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola empowers businesses to grow through performance advertising technology that goes beyond search and social and delivers measurable outcomes at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola works with thousands of businesses who advertise directly on Realize, Taboola’s powerful ad platform, reaching approximately 600M daily active users across some of the best publishers in the world. Publishers like NBC News, Yahoo, and OEMs such as Samsung, Xiaomi and others use Taboola’s technology to grow audience and revenue, enabling Realize to offer unique data, specialized algorithms, and unmatched scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-JN1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realize your potential by joining the leading performance-driven advertising company in the open web! &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Taboola is looking for a driven and ambitious Team Lead to join our Global Growth Advertiser Sales team, focusing on the UK and French markets. The Growth department sits at the heart of Taboola’s success - helping advertisers grow through innovative strategies and delivering measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting step into management, where you’ll be expected to lead by example. You’ll combine hands-on sales with guiding a new business team: building strong pipelines, forecasting accurately, and exceeding sales targets. Acting as both player and coach, you’ll research, engage, and close new advertisers while inspiring your team to do the same. Your leadership and sales skills will directly expand client portfolios and fuel long-term growth at Taboola.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To thrive in this role, you’ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or professional fluency in English (French as a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for sales and a hunger to close deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years’ experience in sales, ideally in digital media, with proven achievements and leadership skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience structuring and negotiating deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in online content and relationship-building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical skills to turn client conversations and data trends into business insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid technical aptitude and the ability to quickly learn campaign tools for effective optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prioritisation skills to manage competing demands while hitting objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in English (French as a nice-to-have)&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in ad tech, social media marketing, or performance advertising&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of media buying KPIs (CPM, CTR, ROAS, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with sales tools (Salesforce, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Clay, Apollo, Lusha, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;E-commerce/Shopify experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative pitching and storytelling (e.g., Canva)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional languages (especially French)&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and inspire: recruit, manage, and motivate a high-performing new business team while leading from the front&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win new business: build a strong pipeline, generate leads, and close deals to consistently hit targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop: guide your team through the sales cycle, sharing best practices and driving results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally: partner with Marketing, Product, and Account Management to enhance lead generation and client success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape advertiser strategies: design tailored media plans that deliver against client objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships: act as a strategic advisor, bringing data-driven insights and handling negotiations with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay on top of the numbers: ensure accurate forecasting, reporting, and Salesforce tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Taboola: attend industry events and strengthen Taboola’s market presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
